      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785038066882,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Collection of predefined classes ,methods and interfaces is called \nLibrary.\n\n2. comes either bundled with language or can be downloaded from\ninternet.\n\n3.example-\n         \n     standard library -  Java Base Library, JDBC library.\n\n     Third party library - twilo, iText, apache commons\n\n      ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Collection of predefined classes ,methods and interfaces is called \nLibrary.\n\n2. comes either bundled with language or can be downloaded from\ninternet.\n\n3.example-\n         \n     standard library -  Java Base Library, JDBC library.\n\n     Third party library - twilo, iText, apache commons\n\n      ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
