      "seed": 386506731,
      "version": 231,
      "versionNonce": 1837504165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785041226238,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Framework is a collection of multiple libraries.\n\n2. Provides foundation on which we can build our code.\n\n3. Provides resuble components.\n\n4. Provides common logic so that we can focus on business logic. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Framework is a collection of multiple libraries.\n\n2. Provides foundation on which we can build our code.\n\n3. Provides resuble components.\n\n4. Provides common logic so that we can focus on business logic. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
